{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10138130","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10138130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1013813001:3":{"text":"테미히아! 다행이다, 다행이야...","source_cn":"特弥希娅！太好了、太好了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DB67A763AF84905","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013813002:1":{"text":"크흠... 내 말은 괜찮으면 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(을)를 걱정 시키지 말란 말이야.","source_cn":"咳……我是说，既然没事，就别让<style=stres...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5DD3F8E52C6D1495","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"크흠... 내 말은 괜찮으면 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(을)를 걱정 시키지 말란 말이야.","female":"크흠... 내 말은 괜찮으면 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(을)를 걱정 시키지 말란 말이야.","variant_male_record_index":"114731","variant_female_record_index":"114732","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013813003:1":{"text":"지금 기분은 어때? 네가 깨어나지 않으면 저 성석을 훔쳐다가...","source_cn":"现在感觉怎么样？事先说明，你要是再不醒，我就去偷了上面...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36D5C942EB7F7B8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1013813004:1":{"text":"아탈란테, 성기사 앞에서 그런 말을 하다니... 내가 못 들은 척해야 하나요?","source_cn":"阿塔兰忒，在圣骑士面前说这种话……我该装作没听到吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA18677DDC16DFF8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1013813004":{"text":"아탈란테, 성기사 앞에서 그런 말을 하다니..